OL,3,CMan City verdict has 'significant
OL,4,Cimplications for integrity of the
OL,5,Cgame' ` FA
OL,7,FThe Football Association says it is
OL,8,F"carefully considering" the
OL,9,Fimplications of the findings into
OL,10,FManchester City.
OL,12,FAn independent commission found City
OL,13,Fguilty on all charges related to
OL,14,Fbreaching Premier League financial
OL,15,Frules in a damning report released
OL,16,Fearlier this week.
OL,18,FCity are expected to lodge their
OL,19,Fappeal against the verdict before the
OL,20,Fdeadline on Friday 2 October.
OL,26,@pD@AOUpD@WO]
