OL,3,CMan City verdict has 'significant
OL,4,Cimplications for integrity of the
OL,5,Cgame' ` FA
OL,7,FA statement on The FA website read:
OL,8,F"The independent commission's decision
OL,9,Fhas significant implications for the
OL,10,Fintegrity of the game.
OL,12,F"We are carefully considering the
OL,13,Fdecision and its implications and will
OL,14,Ftake action where appropriate.
OL,16,F"As proceedings between the Premier
OL,17,FLeague and Manchester City Football
OL,18,FClub remain ongoing, we do not intend
OL,19,Fto comment further at this stage. We
OL,20,Fwill, however, continue to monitor
OL,21,Fdevelopments closely."
OL,26,@pD@AOUtD@AOUxD@AOU}D@VO]
