OL,3,CMan City verdict has 'significant
OL,4,Cimplications for integrity of the
OL,5,Cgame' ` FA
OL,7,FIt is understood City intend to
OL,8,Fpresent evidence to an appeal board
OL,9,Fthat they say refutes the key finding
OL,10,Fof the original commission that owner
OL,11,Ffunding was being disguised as
OL,12,Fsponsorship revenue.
OL,14,FThe commission concluded more than
OL,15,F#830million of such funding was used
OL,16,Fto inflate revenues and enable the
OL,17,Fclub to comply with Premier League and
OL,18,FUEFA financial rules through a series
OL,19,Fof "sham" arrangements.
OL,26,@{D@DOU{D@IO]
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G3/5
