OL,3,CMan City verdict has 'significant
OL,4,Cimplications for integrity of the
OL,5,Cgame' ` FA
OL,7,FAt the heart of the club's appeal will
OL,8,Fbe an insistence that government
OL,9,Ffunding, provided via the Abu Dhabi
OL,10,FCrown Prince Court (CPC), gave
OL,11,Ffinancial assistance to sponsors in
OL,12,Fthe emirate to help them to fulfil
OL,13,Ftheir liabilities to City, rather than
OL,14,FSheikh Mansour's Abu Dhabi United
OL,15,FGroup (ADUG) company, which owns the
OL,16,Fclub.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G4/5
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
