OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F306A1791209901
OL,3,CMan City verdict has 'significant
OL,4,Cimplications for integrity of the
OL,5,Cgame' ` FA
OL,7,FThe 40-page core decision published on
OL,8,FTuesday shows the independent
OL,9,Fcommission rejected the CPC
OL,10,Fexplanation as "untrue" in its
OL,11,Ffindings, adding: "We concluded that
OL,12,Fit was an 'explanation' that the club
OL,13,Fhad concocted well after the event in
OL,14,Fan attempt to obscure and conceal the
OL,15,Frealities of the disguised funding
OL,16,Fscheme."
OL,18,FWant more on the issues affecting the
OL,19,FNorth? Our podcast, From the North
OL,20,Fanswers the questions that matter to
OL,21,Four region.
